Author: Qwen AI Assistant <qwen@example.com>
Date:   Sat May 9 04:15:17 2026 -0500

    fix: harden upstream plugin failure points
    
    - Upgrade flutter_foreground_task 9.1.0→9.2.2 which fixes
      ForegroundServiceDidNotStartInTime on Android 16 (OBTAINIUMPLUS-1N)
    - Wrap startForegroundService/stopForegroundService in try/catch so a
      service-start failure in build() can't propagate uncaught
    - Wrap BackgroundFetch.finish() in headless task handler (same pattern
      already applied to main.dart's initPlatformState)
    - Fire-and-forget onRepeatEvent's bgUpdateCheck now uses .catchError()
      instead of silently dropping errors
    - Wrap pm.openApp() in try/catch to handle 'kotlin.Unit' plugin errors
      without crashing the binary message listener (OBTAINIUMPLUS-1H breadcrumbs)
    
