    feat: enhance UI performance, onboarding, and adaptive layouts
    
    Summary of changes:
    - UI Refinement: Removed redundant 'Apps' title in AppsPage and merged functionalities into AppBar.
    - Modern Onboarding: Integrated introduction_screen for a unified, device-aware setup process.
    - Automated Troubleshooting: Added proactive detection and guidance for Samsung (Usage Access) and Xiaomi (Battery Optimization) devices.
    - Performance Optimization: Implemented Image.memory cacheWidth/Height to significantly reduce memory footprint of app icons.
    - Background Processing: Moved heavy JSON encoding during Export to a background isolate to prevent UI freezes.
    - Modern Navigation: Migrated to go_router for robust, state-based navigation and improved deep-link handling.
    - Adaptive Layouts: Implemented wide-screen optimizations including a 2-column AppPage and centered AppListView.
    - UX Improvements: Added skeleton loading (shimmer) for the app list and standardized UI effects using the shimmer package.
    - Internationalization: Updated English, Spanish, and French translations with new strings and improvements.
    - Workflow Enhancement: Updated build-apk workflow to generate detailed changelogs from commit bodies.
    
    Co-authored-by: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>

